# TypeScript and Vercel

- Use strict TypeScript; avoid `any` unless justified at a boundary.
- Next.js App Router: colocate route handlers under `src/app/api/`, use server boundaries intentionally.
- Environment: document required vars in `.env.local.example`; never commit `.env.local`.
- See `docs/architecture/system-overview.md` for deployment assumptions.
